    "title": "Single-family home in Schuylkill Haven sells for $125,000 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Real Estate Newswire ,\n15 hours ago An single-family home, built in 1953, has changed hands. The home at 915 East Main Street in Schuylkill Haven was sold on Dec. 17, 2025. The purchase price was $125,000. This single-story house has two bedrooms and one bathroom. The property is equipped with hot water heating. Additionally, the home includes access to one parking spot. The property's lot measures 13,939 square feet. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
